{"requestId":"f8b93067b89f461bb3cd6d35f712038f","modelId":"hy3","modelName":"Hy3","isHelperMessage":false,"traceId":"dc90f9ab4723166422be5f9cf1383797","toolStatus":{"chatcmpl-tool-9bd3b21b6ea00b79":{"ready":true,"status":"executed","args":{"filePath":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/ui.c","offset":3500,"limit":130},"result":{"status":"success","success":true,"result":{"type":"read_file_result","path":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/ui.c","content":"  3500:#if __has_include("driver/temperature_sensor.h")
  3501:#include "driver/temperature_sensor.h"
  3502:#define SYSINFO_HAS_TEMP 1
  3503:#endif
  3504:
  3505:static lv_obj_t *g_sysinfo_screen = NULL;
  3506:static lv_obj_t *g_sysinfo_labels[11];
  3507:static lv_timer_t *g_sysinfo_timer = NULL;
  3508:#ifdef SYSINFO_HAS_TEMP
  3509:static temperature_sensor_handle_t s_ts = NULL;
  3510:#endif
  3511:
  3512:static void sysinfo_timer_cb(lv_timer_t *t)
  3513:{
  3514:    (void)t;
  3515:    uint8_t mac[6];
  3516:    esp_read_mac(mac, ESP_MAC_WIFI_STA);
  3517:    int f  = (int)(heap_caps_get_free_size(MALLOC_CAP_INTERNAL) / 1024);
  3518:    int b  = (int)(heap_caps_get_largest_free_block(MALLOC_CAP_INTERNAL) / 1024);
  3519:    int pf = (int)(heap_caps_get_free_size(MALLOC_CAP_SPIRAM) / 1024);
  3520:    int pt = (int)(esp_psram_get_size() / 1024);
  3521:    esp_chip_info_t ci; esp_chip_info(&ci);
  3522:
  3523:    lv_label_set_text_fmt(g_sysinfo_labels[0],  "CPU 频率:    %d MHz", esp_get_cpu_freq_mhz());
  3524:    lv_label_set_text_fmt(g_sysinfo_labels[1],  "内部 RAM:    空闲 %d KB", f);
  3525:    lv_label_set_text_fmt(g_sysinfo_labels[2],  "内部 RAM:    最大块 %d KB", b);
  3526:    lv_label_set_text_fmt(g_sysinfo_labels[3],  "PSRAM:       空闲 %d KB", pf);
  3527:    lv_label_set_text_fmt(g_sysinfo_labels[4],  "PSRAM:       总量 %d KB", pt);
  3528:    lv_label_set_text_fmt(g_sysinfo_labels[5],  "芯片:        ESP32-S3  x%d", ci.cores);
  3529:    lv_label_set_text_fmt(g_sysinfo_labels[6],  "SDK:         %s", esp_get_idf_version());
  3530:    lv_label_set_text_fmt(g_sysinfo_labels[7],  "MAC:         %02X:%02X:%02X:%02X:%02X:%02X",
  3531:                          mac[0], mac[1], mac[2], mac[3], mac[4], mac[5]);
  3532:    lv_label_set_text_fmt(g_sysinfo_labels[8],  "WiFi:        %s", g_wifi_on ? "已连接" : "未连接");
  3533:#ifdef SYSINFO_HAS_TEMP
  3534:    if (s_ts) {
  3535:        float tp = 0;
  3536:        if (temperature_sensor_get_celsius(s_ts, &tp) == ESP_OK)
  3537:            lv_label_set_text_fmt(g_sysinfo_labels[9], "芯片温度:    %.1f °C", tp);
  3538:        else
  3539:            lv_label_set_text(g_sysinfo_labels[9], "芯片温度:    读取失败");
  3540:    } else {
  3541:        lv_label_set_text(g_sysinfo_labels[9], "芯片温度:    未启用");
  3542:    }
  3543:#else
  3544:    lv_label_set_text(g_sysinfo_labels[9], "芯片温度:    未启用(需 temperature_sensor)");
  3545:#endif
  3546:    lv_label_set_text_fmt(g_sysinfo_labels[10], "编译:        %s %s", __DATE__, __TIME__);
  3547:}
  3548:
  3549:static void build_sysinfo_screen(lv_obj_t *scr)
  3550:{
  3551:    lv_obj_t *cont = lv_obj_create(scr);
  3552:    lv_obj_set_size(cont, LCD_W - 10, LCD_H - 86);
  3553:    lv_obj_align(cont, LV_ALIGN_TOP_MID, 0, 62);
  3554:    lv_obj_set_style_bg_opa(cont, LV_OPA_TRANSP, 0);
  3555:    lv_obj_set_style_border_opa(cont, LV_OPA_TRANSP, 0);
  3556:    lv_obj_set_style_shadow_opa(cont, LV_OPA_TRANSP, 0);
  3557:    lv_obj_set_style_radius(cont, 0, 0);
  3558:    lv_obj_set_style_pad_all(cont, 6, 0);
  3559:    lv_obj_set_flex_flow(cont, LV_FLEX_FLOW_COLUMN);
  3560:    lv_obj_set_flex_align(cont, LV_FLEX_ALIGN_START, LV_FLEX_ALIGN_START, LV_FLEX_ALIGN_START);
  3561:    lv_obj_set_style_pad_row(cont, 8, 0);
  3562:    lv_obj_add_flag(cont, LV_OBJ_FLAG_SCROLLABLE);
  3563:    lv_obj_set_scroll_dir(cont, LV_DIR_VER);
  3564:
  3565:    for (int i = 0; i < 11; i++) {
  3566:        lv_obj_t *l = lv_label_create(cont);
  3567:        lv_obj_set_width(l, LCD_W - 22);
  3568:        lv_obj_set_style_text_font(l, &lv_font_cn_16, 0);
  3569:        lv_obj_set_style_text_color(l, lv_color_white(), 0);
  3570:        lv_label_set_text(l, "");
  3571:        g_sysinfo_labels[i] = l;
  3572:    }
  3573:
  3574:#ifdef SYSINFO_HAS_TEMP
  3575:    temperature_sensor_config_t cfg = TEMPERATURE_SENSOR_CONFIG_DEFAULT(-10, 80);
  3576:    if (temperature_sensor_install(&cfg, &s_ts) != ESP_OK) s_ts = NULL;
  3577:    if (s_ts) temperature_sensor_enable(s_ts);
  3578:#endif
  3579:
  3580:    g_sysinfo_timer = lv_timer_create(sysinfo_timer_cb, 1000, NULL);
  3581:    sysinfo_timer_cb(g_sysinfo_timer);   /* 进界面立即刷一次 */
  3582:}
  3583:
  3584:static const char *app_id_name(int id)
  3585:{
  3586:    switch (id) {
