/esp32s3/index.html","site":"documentation.espressif.com","snippet":"ESP32-S3 硬件设计指南 乐鑫技术文档。请注意这些芯片管脚最多连接一个 flash 和一个 PSRAM,即当封装内仅有 flash 时,被 flash 占用的管脚只能再连接一个 PSRAM,不能用于其他功能;封装内仅有 PSRAM 时,被 PSRAM 占用的管脚只能再连接一个 flash;封装内同时有 flash 和 PSRAM 时,被占用的管脚不能再连接 flash 或 PSRAM。 芯片与封装内 Quad SPI Flash 的管脚对应关系 ESP32-S3FN8/ESP32-S3FH4R2 封装内 Flash (Quad SPI) SPICLK CLK SPICS0 CS# SPID DI SPIQ DO SPIWP WP# SPIHD HOLD# 芯片与封装内 Quad SPI PSRAM 的管脚对应关系 ESP32-S3R2/ESP32-S3FH4R2 封装内 PSRAM (2 MB, Quad SPI) SPICLK CLK SPICS1 CE# SPID SI/SIO0 SPIQ SO/SIO1 SPIWP SIO2 SPIHD SIO3 芯片与封装内 Octal ...","favicon":"https://cdn-yb.icon.qq.com/zuowei_dir/documentation_espressif_com.ico","highlights":[],"content":""},{"title":"Waveshare ESP32-S3-ETH","url":"https://www.espboards.dev/esp32/waveshare-esp32-s3-eth/","site":"ESPboards","snippet":"Waveshare ESP32-S3-ETH ESPboards。 JTAG MTDO 32 39 IO39GPIO39 strapping pwm Camera PCLK when a camera is fitted; JTAG MTCK 33 - GND ground - Ground 34 38 IO38GPIO38 safe pwm Camera D5 when a camera is fitted 35 37 IO37GPIO37 strapping - Reserved by the octal PSRAM - not usable as GPIO 36 36 IO36GPIO36 strapping - Reserved by the octal PSRAM - not usable as GPIO 37 35 IO35GPIO35 strapping - Reserved by the octal PSRAM - not usable as GPIO 38 - GND ground - Ground 39 34 IO34GPIO34 strapping - Reser...","favicon":"https://cdn-yb.icon.qq.com/zuowei_dir/www_espboards_dev.ico","highlights":[],"content":""},{"title":"Espressif ESP32-S3R8","url":"https://github.com/shaoguoji/hardware-doc/blob/main/components/espressif/esp32-s3r8/README.md","site":"GitHub","snippet":"Espressif ESP32-S3R8 GitHub。 they are pinned here by SHA-256 and retrieval date. Caveats Do not describe the board's 16 MB W25Q128 flash as part of ESP32-S3R8. GPIO0 is also brought into the board's unusual USB/target selection circuitry. Used By The entire LilyGO T-Display-S3 family — eleven boards, every one of which uses the ESP32-S3R8, as a bare die rather than a module: T-Display-S3 and Touch, AMOLED, AMOLED P