{"requestId":"5aaf926e56dd498cbe21f3695f51c42c","modelId":"hy4free","modelName":"Hy4","isHelperMessage":false,"traceId":"413b7868b0d4b06f9b7198a531b2a501","toolStatus":{"chatcmpl-tool-be2e48545debda68":{"ready":true,"status":"executed","args":{"filePath":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/sd_card.c"},"result":{"status":"success","success":true,"result":{"type":"read_file_result","path":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/sd_card.c","content":"     1:#include "sd_card.h"
