- 遍历 chunk 找 "fmt " (audioFormat=1 PCM, channels, sampleRate, bitsPerSample) 和 "data"
- 计算 dur_ms = data_bytes / (rate*ch*bits/8) * 1000
- seek: fseek(data_off + ms * bytes_per_sec / 1000)，对齐到 sample frame

