WAV 解析细节：
```c
typedef struct {
    uint32_t rate;
    uint16_t channels;
    uint16_t bits;
    uint32_t data_off;
    uint32_t data_size;
    uint32_t byte_rate;
    uint16_t block_align;
} wav_t;
```
