{"requestId":"670d13c5241a40eb827f5f7cbdb2137f","modelId":"hy4free","modelName":"Hy4","isHelperMessage":false,"traceId":"b408e20625ef8ad76e6986d19c103817","toolStatus":{"chatcmpl-tool-8992f7927f7e2bab":{"ready":true,"status":"executed","args":{"filePath":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/file_mgr.h"},"result":{"status":"success","success":true,"result":{"type":"read_file_result","path":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/file_mgr.h","content":"     1:#pragma once
     2:
     3:#include "lvgl.h"
     4:
     5:/* 文件管理 App：浏览 SD 卡（SDMMC + FATFS）上的目录、查看文本文件、删除文件。
     6: *
     7: * 用法（与 ui.c 的懒加载机制配套）：
     8: *   1) ui.c 首次打开 App 时：make_app_screen("文件管理") + build_file_manager_screen(scr)
     9: *   2) 立刻调用 file_mgr_on_open()，请求挂载 SD 卡并列出根目录
    10: *   3) 主循环里每圈调用 file_mgr_periodic()，真正执行挂载/列目录/读文件/删除
    11: *      （这些操作会阻塞，不能放进 LVGL 输入事件回调里做，否则卡看门狗）
    12: */
    13:
    14:/* 单屏最多显示的条目数：受 LVGL 对象数量限制（每行 3 个对象），
    15: * 超过 FM_MAX_ROWS 的目录只显示前 FM_MAX_ROWS 项，状态栏会提示。 */
    16:#define FILE_MGR_MAX_ROWS 32
    17:
    18:/* 构建界面（只调用一次，屏幕对象由 ui.c 的 make_app_screen 创建） */
    19:void build_file_manager_screen(lv_obj_t *scr);
    20:
    21:/* 在当前目录里找上一个/下一个「同类」媒体文件（图片↔图片，视频↔视频）。
    22: * cur: 当前文件完整路径；dir: -1 上一个 / +1 下一个；out: 结果路径。
    23: * 用于图片查看器的「上一张 / 下一张」。 */
    24:bool file_mgr_media_neighbor(const char *cur, int dir, char *out, size_t out_n);
    25:
    26:/* 进入 App：请求挂载 + 列根目录 */
    27:void file_mgr_on_open(void);
    28:
    29:/* 主循环调用：执行延迟的挂载/列目录/预览/删除，并刷新界面 */
    30:void file_mgr_periodic(void);
    31:","totalLineCount":31,"hasMore":false,"hint":""}}},"chatcmpl-tool-83be4e5d50ea1ef2":{"ready":true,"status":"executed","args":{"filePath":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/file_mgr.c","offset":785,"limit":45},"result":{"status":"success","success":true,"result":{"type":"read_file_result","path":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/file_mgr.c","content":"   785:
   786:void file_mgr_periodic(void)
   787:{
   788:    if (s_cmd == FM_CMD_NONE) {
   789:        return;
   790:    }
   791:    fm_cmd_t cmd = s_cmd;
   792:    s_cmd = FM_CMD_NONE;
   793:
   794:    switch (cmd) {
   795:    case FM_CMD_MOUNT:
   796:        if (s_status_label) {
   797:            lv_label_set_text(s_status_label, "正在挂载 SD 卡...");
   798:        }
   799:        if (sd_card_mount(true) == ESP_OK) {
   800:            snprintf(s_cwd, sizeof(s_cwd), "%s", SD_MOUNT_POINT);
   801:            snprintf(s_cmd_path, sizeof(s_cmd_path), "%s", s_cwd);
   802:            s_cmd = FM_CMD_LIST;              /* 挂上后立刻列根目录 */
   803:        } else {
   804:            snprintf(s_flash, sizeof(s_flash), "未挂载，点刷新重试");
   805:            s_cnt = 0;
   806:            s_total = 0;
   807:            fm_update_ui();
   808:        }
   809:        break;
   810:    case FM_CMD_LIST:
   811:        snprintf(s_cwd, sizeof(s_cwd), "%s", s_cmd_path);
   812:        fm_list_dir(s_cwd);
   813:        break;
   814:    case FM_CMD_VIEW:
   815:        fm_view_file(s_cmd_path);
   816:        break;
   817:    case FM_CMD_IMAGE:
   818:        lv_obj_add_flag(s_detail, LV_OBJ_FLAG_HIDDEN);   /* 进看图，详情页收起来 */
   819:        media_image_open(s_cmd_path);
   820:        break;
   821:    case FM_CMD_DELETE:
   822:        fm_delete(s_cmd_path);
   823:        break;
   824:    default:
   825:        break;
   826:    }
   827:}
   828:","totalLineCount":828,"hasMore":false,"hint":""}}},"chatcmpl-tool-bccedf966d059727":{"ready":true,"status":"executed","args":{"filePath":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/ui.c","offset":4040,"limit":22},"result":{"status":"success","success":true,"result":{"type":"read_file_result","path":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/ui.c","content":"  4040:        scr = g_settings_screen;
  4041:        break;
  4042:    case APP_CLOCK:
  4043:        if (!g_clock_screen) {
  4044:            g_clock_screen = make_app_screen("时钟");
  4045:            build_clock_screen(g_clock_screen);
  4046:        }
  4047:        scr = g_clock_screen;
  4048:        break;
  4049:    case APP_MUSIC:
  4050:        if (!g_music_screen) { g_music_screen = make_app_screen("音乐"); build_music_screen(g_music_screen); }
  4051:        scr = g_music_screen;
  4052:        break;
  4053:    case APP_GAME:
  4054:        /* 弹出选择菜单: 2048 / 贪吃蛇 二选一, 不直接切屏 */
