`s_out` 需要 `samples*2 <= 2304`，即 `samples <= 1152`，MINIMP3_MAX_SAMPLES_PER_FRAME=2304 够。安全 clamp：`if (samples > MINIMP3_MAX_SAMPLES_PER_FRAME/2) samples = ...`。

