关键函数：

```c
static uint16_t rd16(...)
static uint32_t rd32(...)
static uint32_t be32(const uint8_t *p)  // 大端
```

`track_info_t`：
```c
typedef struct {
    uint32_t rate;
    uint16_t channels;
    uint16_t bits;
    uint32_t data_off;
    uint32_t data_size;
    uint32_t frame_bytes;
