{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在改 build 里的候选栏和收起按钮。候选栏用绝对坐标 + 独立视觉（背景、边框、圆角）："},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-92772054531da041","toolName":"replace_in_file","args":{"filePath":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/ui.c","old_str":"    lv_obj_t *cand = lv_ime_pinyin_get_cand_panel(g_ai_ime);
    if (cand) {
