{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"清楚了。官方推荐"单一所有者"模型，而且有个更优雅的路径：**保留底层 `sdmmc_card_t`，只切换上层挂载**——不用 deinit host。

关键是 `esp_vfs_fat_sdcard_unmount()` 会 free card，所以不能直接用它。但有个底层 API `f_mount(0, ...)` + `ff_diskio_unregister()` 可以只卸载 FATFS 层而保留 card。

不过这涉及操作 FATFS 内部结构，风险较高。让我看看 esp_tinyusb 是否提供了现成的"FATFS ↔ MSC 移交"辅助 API（很多 Espressif 例程用 `esp_vfs_fat_sdmmc_mount` 配合 TinyUSB 的 CDC+MSC 组合）："},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-b905deae7a45784a","toolName":"DeferExecuteTool","args":{"toolName":"web_fetch","params":{"url":"https://github.com/espressif/esp-iot-solution/tree/master/examples/usb/device/usb_msc","fetchInfo":"List the files and subdirectories in this USB MSC example, and identify whether there is a specific example for sharing SD card between FATFS and USB MSC (sometimes called usb_msc_fatfs or msc_sdcard). Return the exact example directory names and key source file names.","explanation":"查找官方 FATFS+MSC 共享 SD 卡的示例目录。"}}}]}

