两处独立修改，一起做："},{"type":"tool-call","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-9f31a0044c1ec6db","toolName":"replace_in_file","args":{"filePath":"c:/esp32/LCD/main/usb_msc.c","old_str":"    if (s_state != USB_MSC_ACTIVE) {
